OL,5,G2100 Taggart
OL,6,     FJardine and the team investigate
OL,7,     Fmurky going-ons at a football club
OL,8,     Fwhose lack of success on the pitch
OL,9,     Fis matched by an unaccountably
OL,10,     Fhigh death rate among its
OL,11,     Femployees.
OL,12,G2305 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,13,     FJudy goes on the run, seeking to
OL,14,     Fget to America. Bea gets on the
OL,15,     Fwork release scheme, with an
OL,16,     Fulterior motive - but Noeline and
OL,17,     FMargo set to stop her. Gail's kids
OL,18,     Fare taken to a home.
